# 2026-08-25: dashboard/traj grew to 8.5 GB / 205k files (three 261-task arms
# landed back to back) and blew past Vercel's deployment limits -- production
# deploys started failing outright. The trajectory viewer is a local debugging
# tool, not something the hosted dashboard needs to serve.
#
# This ONLY excludes the directory from what gets uploaded to Vercel. The files
# stay in git and on disk, untouched. Open them locally instead:
#   file:///.../CUA/dashboard/traj/sft/<arm>/index.html
#
# Consequence: the per-arm "trajectory" links on the hosted scoreboard 404.
# The scoreboard itself, the 361 view and both JSON feeds are unaffected --
# index.html fetches those from raw.githubusercontent at runtime, not from
# the deployment.
dashboard/traj/
